(Leonard:)The girls are gone,
we have 48 hours.

3
00:00:03,895 --> 00:00:06,265
(Leonard:)There are no distractions.
Let's change the world.

4
00:00:06,264 --> 00:00:08,834
(Sheldon:)Thinking caps on.
Here we go.

5
00:00:08,833 --> 00:00:10,333
(Raj:)Ooh, this is exciting.
We're innovating.

6
00:00:10,334 --> 00:00:12,264
(Raj:)I feel like
we're in the Facebook movie.

7
00:00:12,270 --> 00:00:14,040
(Howard:)Oh. I never saw that.

8
00:00:14,038 --> 00:00:15,838
Yeah. Really?
KOOTHRAPPALI:
Oh.

9
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:17,940
(Raj:)It's wonderful, and I swear
I'm not saying that

10
00:00:17,942 --> 00:00:19,942
(Raj:)because Justin Timberlake
is in it.

11
00:00:21,212 --> 00:00:23,012
(Sheldon:)Yeah, I have it on Blu-ray.

12
00:00:23,014 --> 00:00:24,414
(Sheldon:)We should watch it.

13
00:00:24,415 --> 00:00:26,485
(Raj:)Cool. I'll make the popcorn.

14
00:00:27,418 --> 00:00:28,848
(Leonard:)Guys...

15
00:00:28,853 --> 00:00:30,353
(Leonard:)in 30 seconds, we went from

16
00:00:30,354 --> 00:00:32,454
"Let's change the world"
to "Let's watch TV."

17
00:00:33,391 --> 00:00:36,261
I'm sorry. Is that a "no"?

18
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:37,560
WOLOWITZ:
Okay. No.

19
00:00:37,562 --> 00:00:38,832
(Howard:)Leonard's right.
We're here to focus.

20
00:00:38,829 --> 00:00:40,859
(Howard:)Didn't we used
to have a list of all our ideas?

21
00:00:40,865 --> 00:00:42,595
