22
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:44,270
(Sheldon:)I did not get a clear answer.

23
00:00:44,268 --> 00:00:46,238
(Sheldon:)I'm gonna set this down now.

24
00:00:47,204 --> 00:00:49,004
(Leonard:)Ah, here it is.

25
00:00:49,006 --> 00:00:50,676
(laughs)
Whoa.

26
00:00:50,675 --> 00:00:52,505
(Leonard:)I haven't looked
at these in years.

27
