"Robot girlfriend."

28
00:00:54,111 --> 00:00:56,441
(Howard:)Mm, that was mine.

29
00:00:56,447 --> 00:00:59,787
"Robot prostitute."

30
00:00:59,784 --> 00:01:02,354
(Howard:)Also mine.

